ations, and we are raising our full year guidance for IonQ to a range of $280 million to $290 million in revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/ionq-ionq-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IONQ 2026 Q3","e":"ionq","d":"2026-11-05","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Niccolo de Masi","x":"…will offer incredible next-generation positioning, navigation, and time GPS opportunities, precisely because we can manufacture and drive integrated photonics along with the world's most accurate clocks, also deployed in multiple theaters of war, if you will, from submarines to satellites.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/ionq-ionq-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IONQ 2026 Q3","e":"ionq","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Niccolo de Masi","x":"Superion 256 will be the first on-premise quantum computing deployment at the NVIDIA Accelerated Quantum Research Center, connected directly to NVIDIA's AI supercomputing infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/ionq-ionq-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IONQ 2026 Q3","e":"ionq","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Niccolo de Masi","x":"We'll be doing research with NVIDIA on, of course, the future of what GPU-based machine learning and QPU-based AI can do.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/ionq-ionq-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IONQ 2026 Q3","e":"ionq","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Inder Singh","x":"At Investor Day in September, we raised our guidance for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/ionq-ionq-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[63,1,9353,0,0,0,7978,690],[64,1,10730,1,0,1,5688,4470],[65,1,7323,0,0,0,6413,410],[66,1,10792,1,1,0,9298,1173],[67,1,12310,1,0,1,4817,7163]],"cinema":[[63,1,9353,0,0,0,7978,690],[64,1,10730,0,0,0,5688,4470],[65,1,7323,0,0,0,6